WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:03.202
I JUST FINISHED EPISODE FOUR.
SO, THE LANNISTERS

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:05.371
- ARE THE BLONDE PEOPLE.
- MM-HMM.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:07.140
- AND THE FEMALE LANNISTER
IS MARRIED

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.143
TO ROBERT BARANTHEON,
WHO IS THE KING.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.477
- IS IT BARANTHEON
OR BARATHEON?

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.112
- RIGHT, RIGHT.

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:17.450
- AND THEN THE OTHER
BLONDE GIRL IS THE, UH--

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.052
- CAN I GET YOU SOMETHING?

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.520
- OH, I DON'T KNOW, UM--

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.823
THREE KAMIKAZE SHOTS,
WHATEVER.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:27.093
OH, MY GOD, I CAN'T BELIEVE
HE JUST DID THAT.

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.294
- WHAT'S THAT?

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.063
- SERVED ME
BEFORE YOU GUYS.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:33.132
I'M REALLY AGAINST THAT.
I'M SO SORRY.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.635
- NO, IT'S OKAY.
WE, UH--WE'VE GOT BEERS.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:40.306
- NO, I MEAN, I'M SORRY
ABOUT EVERYTHING.

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:42.108
- OH, THAT'S FINE.
IT'S FINE.

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:45.378
- NO, NO, IT'S BEEN
100 YEARS OF NOT FINE.

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.213
I MEAN, 20 YEARS AGO,

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:49.549
YOU GUYS WOULDN'T HAVE EVEN
BEEN ALLOWED IN HERE.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.552
- 20 YEARS--
THAT WOULD BE 1992.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:59.125
- YOU'RE BOTH
REALLY BEAUTIFUL.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.493
- OH, SHE'S DONE.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.328
- THAT JUST HAPPENED,
DIDN'T IT?

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.730
- MM-HMM.
- YEAH, AMAZING.

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:06.332
- SO, THE LANNISTERS--

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.134
OKAY, SHE'S THE QUEEN.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.735
- JAIME LANNISTER
IS THE OTHER ONE.

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:11.471
- JAIME AND--
- YO, YO, YO, WHAT UP, MAN?

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.073
HEY, GIVE ME ANOTHER LAGER,
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:17.076
SPILLED MY LAST ONE ON MY TRIBE
SHIRT--CAN YOU BELIEVE THAT?

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.479
BUT WHATEVS,
GOT THIS THING IN '93--

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.515
MIDNIGHT MARAUDERS TOUR.
CHECK THAT OUT.

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.250
IT'S EVERYWHERE.
- MM-HMM.

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:27.753
- HEY, UH, WHO'S YOUR
FAVORITE MEMBER OF TRIBE?

00:01:27.786 --> 00:01:31.057
- SMOK--SMOKE--SMOKY.
KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.827
LOVE HIM, DUDE, MORE BEHIND
THE SCENES, BUT HE WAS, LIKE--

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.696
ALL RIGHT, GOOD.
SEE YOU GUYS AROUND, THOUGH.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.531
- MM-HMM. OKAY.
- COOL.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:40.500
- ONE MORE, ONE MORE, ONE MORE.
COME ON, SON.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:43.202
BOOM.
ALL RIGHT, LATE.

00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:45.705
- OH, HE SPUN. HE SPUN.
- WOW.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.840
- SECOND PERSON TO NOT WAIT
FOR THEIR DRINK, BY THE WAY.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.275
- YEP.

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:50.776
OKAY, LET ME
ASK YOU THIS, THEN.

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.311
WHAT'S
WITH THE BARBARIAN DUDE

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:53.846
WHO LOOKS LIKE
A HUGE DAVE NAVARRO?

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:55.248
- OKAY.
- WHO'S THAT GUY?

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.782
- OH...

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:59.852
I NEED A DRINK. [chuckles]
JUST FINISHED<i> AMISTAD.</i>

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:02.155
I SAW IT 3 TIMES, AND
I'LL SEE IT 100 MORE TIMES,

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.756
BECAUSE, LIKE,
I'M HAPPY TO DO IT.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.525
IF THAT'S WHAT
THOSE GUYS WENT THROUGH,

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.027
I'M HAPPY TO SIT THROUGH IT,
YOU KNOW, 300 MORE TIMES

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.228
OR WHATEVER,
YOU KNOW, IT TAKES.

00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:10.730
- YEAH, IT'S PRETTY INTENSE.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.798
- SEE, MY THING IS,
IS, LIKE, I DON'T THINK

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:15.735
ONE PERSON SHOULD OWN
ANOTHER PERSON, PERIOD.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:17.103
- I'M GLAD THAT THAT'S WHAT
YOU GOT FROM THAT MOVIE.

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.038
- THAT'S A TRUE STATEMENT.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:20.706
- YEAH, I MEAN, I DON'T CARE
WHEN IT HAPPENED, ALL RIGHT?

00:02:20.739 --> 00:02:22.375
IT SHOULD NEVER HAPPEN.
IT SHOULD NEVER OCCUR.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.709
BUT, LIKE, I'M PREACHING
TO THE CHOIR.

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:25.344
YOU GUYS KNOW
WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT.

00:02:25.377 --> 00:02:26.812
- YEAH, WE DO.

00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:28.781
IT'S LIKE, WHY DID
ANYBODY EVEN DO THAT?

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:30.416
I'M, LIKE, "NO, YOU DIDN'T.
NO, YOU DIDN'T.

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:32.051
WHAT YOU DOING, GIRLFRIEND?
NO, YOU DIDN'T."

00:02:32.084 --> 00:02:34.120
I'M ASHAMED.
- YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:36.155
IT'S REALLY PROBABLY OKAY,
BECAUSE YOU WEREN'T THERE.

00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:39.225
- OKAY, WELL, WE CAN COME UP
WITH EXCUSES ALL DAY, ALL DAY.

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:42.195
- IT'S NOT AN EXCUSE SO MUCH.
- LET'S JUST NOT DO THAT.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.763
LET'S NOT DO THAT.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:45.765
- LOOK, HEY,
BOTTOM LINE, WE COOL.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:47.200
RIGHT?
- YEAH.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.734
- ALL RIGHT.
- YEAH, WE ARE COOL.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.269
- WE'RE KICKITY-COOL?
- YES.

00:02:50.302 --> 00:02:51.771
- WHAT'S THAT?

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.573
- DIDN'T SAY ANYTHING.
- NOTHING.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.308
- OH, YOU DIDN'T--

00:02:55.341 --> 00:03:00.112
ALL RIGHT,
FOUR MORE YEARS.

00:03:00.145 --> 00:03:02.081
- HEY, IF IT MAKES
YOU GUYS FEEL ANY BETTER,

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:05.651
BLACK PEOPLE MAKE ME
REALLY UNCOMFORTABLE.

00:03:05.684 --> 00:03:06.653
BOTH: THANK YOU.

